    "direction": {
      "$description": "Sentiment of a change, NOT the arrow's direction. Which way is good is a property of the metric (up is bad for churn, DSO, cycle time), so a surface picks good/bad per metric rather than hardcoding up=green. Always pair with a glyph: ~8% of men cannot use the colour channel, and colour-only direction is a WCAG 1.4.1 failure.",
