      "$description": "Okabe & Ito (2008) colour-universal categorical set, ordered as published. Position 8 substitutes the neutral for Okabe-Ito's black, which is unusable on a dark canvas. Categorical series only — never spend danger/success/warning on an ordinary series, or readers read alarm into it. Beyond 8 categories, use small multiples instead of more hues."
